          "reason": "The staging realm serves only the staging hosts. The seed job reconciles this roster on every staging sync, so redirect URIs added by hand are wiped; declaring them here keeps them. An override replaces the whole field, so each list is the full staging set and attributes repeats PKCE."
        }
      },
